      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start and the tone is exactly what i was looking for. \n\nthe only thing is, i just ran it through the automation tool and the feature density score was pretty low (only 2). the marketing team might flag this as being too \"light\" on information. \n\ncould you try another version that incorporates more of the features from that list? please try to keep it feeling natural and professional like you did before, don't just make it a list, but we really need that score to be higher so it doesn't get buried by the system. thanks!",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
