      "content": "okay, that's definitely better! the score went up which is good.\n\nbut i just got feedback from my manager and they're saying that while the tone is great, the content still feels a bit thin for our high-value tier. they want the email to really emphasize the breadth of the platform so users realize how much they're missing out on. \n\ncould you try one more version? try to get that feature density score even higher—ideally closer to the top of the scale. i still really need you to keep it professional and not just a wall of text, but we really need to show off as much of the platform as possible in this draft.",
